WEBVTT

00:13.481 --> 00:19.565
The storm is over now, the static's gone Right

00:19.666 --> 00:26.130
here is where you've been all along Your voice

00:26.170 --> 00:29.973
was lost, your world was grey We're here to chase

00:30.013 --> 00:33.255
the dark away You walked through fire, you

00:33.295 --> 00:36.878
walked through rain But you will never walk

00:36.978 --> 00:39.560
alone again

00:41.512 --> 00:49.297
We are your sanctuary in the storm A fire here to

00:49.357 --> 00:55.661
keep you safe and warm Inside this circle held so

00:55.721 --> 00:59.344
tight We'll be your true and gentle light So let

00:59.384 --> 01:03.787
the painted smile fall down You're standing on

01:03.827 --> 01:09.851
your native ground Your home

01:12.917 --> 01:14.383
You're finally home

01:20.868 --> 01:25.769
The last few words on the floor You don't need it

01:25.949 --> 01:30.030
anymore The silence has no power here We'll

01:30.090 --> 01:35.411
banish every single fear Just let it go The heavy

01:35.471 --> 01:39.891
load at the ending of this lonely road Just lean

01:39.991 --> 01:44.072
on us, we'll hold the line Your broken heart will

01:44.112 --> 01:45.332
mend, we'll tell

01:55.995 --> 02:05.978
We are your sanctuary in the storm A father here

02:05.998 --> 02:12.019
to keep you safe and warm Inside this circle held

02:12.099 --> 02:15.880
so tight We'll be your true and gentle light So

02:15.940 --> 02:20.021
let the painted smile fall down You're standing

02:20.441 --> 02:26.694
on your native ground You're home

02:29.676 --> 02:33.118
You're finally home

03:12.821 --> 03:15.821
You're home

03:18.822 --> 03:19.702
You're fine

03:24.289 --> 03:29.154
We are your sanctuary You're not alone

